      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "what contains them is us, right? The harness we put them in and the way we prompt them is basically like a function of our understanding of Claude",
      "timestamp_sec": 149,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=149s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We call this capability overhang, right? Claude gets smarter in spiky ways.",
      "timestamp_sec": 239,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=239s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "if you give it arms, like you give it the bash tool and ways to work with the environment, it can build and search its own context. And that's sort of like the insight that led to Claude Code",
      "timestamp_sec": 314,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=314s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "we recently removed 80% of the system prompt for Claude code",
      "timestamp_sec": 347,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=347s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The examples tend to constrain it cuz it's actually more imaginative than the examples we give it.",
