      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=386s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "we tried to give it context and not just constraints. We're really trying to avoid being like, \"Do not do this.\"",
      "timestamp_sec": 386,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=386s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "I really like to emphasize that this is closer to a biology than a physics, right? It's still very empirical, very organic.",
      "timestamp_sec": 499,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=499s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "the plan and prompt and spec that I have in my mind is the map, right? But the territory is the actual code base, the real world, the constraints that Claude needs to navigate",
      "timestamp_sec": 538,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=538s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "whenever Claude runs into something in the territory that's not in the map, I call that an unknown",
      "timestamp_sec": 538,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=538s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Fable is one of the first models where I felt that like I really have to figure out my unknowns because if not, it's going to traverse such a large area that like it's going to run into a lot of them.",
      "timestamp_sec": 577,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=577s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "I like to do what I call a blind spot pass.",
      "timestamp_sec": 646,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=646s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "in many ways, the model knows more about you know, almost everything than I do. I just need to get it out of it.",
      "timestamp_sec": 685,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=685s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "One of the best ways to give Claude a map is to give it another map",
      "timestamp_sec": 757,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=757s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It was like the things that would have taken me weeks, I could do in hours",
      "timestamp_sec": 903,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=903s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "One of my favorite parts of Anthropic is that we believe that tradeoffs are not real.",
      "timestamp_sec": 980,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=980s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "But what if you just did all of it, you know? What if you forced reality to show you the tradeoff, right?",
      "timestamp_sec": 1020,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=1020s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "there are so many tradeoffs that you make implicitly in your head, right? Like good, fast, cheap. Now it's pick three, right?",
      "timestamp_sec": 1020,
      "talk_slug": "field-guide-to-fable",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&t=1020s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
